    "summary": "Manage pipeline and portfolio activities for the Private Sector Credit Enhancement Facility (PSF) in Abidjan. The Program Officer supports risk-participation transactions, portfolio construction, guarantee implementation and resource mobilisation alongside operational coordination of the facility’s work programme.",
