    "summary": "Originate and execute infrastructure investments at DBSA. This Midrand-based role combines deal sourcing, financial modelling and deal structuring with negotiation and credit approval across project finance, corporate finance and structured finance.",
    "aboutRole": "The Investment Officer builds a pipeline of projects suitable for development financing. The role works with Treasury, Legal, Credit and Loan Administration from first assessment through approval and closing, and develops relationships with sponsors, lenders and government counterparts across sub-Saharan Africa.",
